    {
      "fileName": "shining-glory.json",
      "id": "tKC06HYkt1XaWk78",
      "name": "Shining Glory",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "tKC06HYkt1XaWk78",
        "folder": "zuiUcpN5o6pf4AJw",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Shining Glory",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your nimbus is active.</p><hr /><p>With a righteous word, your divine aura inspires your allies to great heroics and causes foes to tremble. Spend 1 Mythic Point. All allies in the bright light of your nimbus gain a +3 status bonus to attack rolls and skill checks, and the status bonus they receive to saving throws against fear increases to +3. These bonuses last for 1 minute or as long as they remain in the bright light of your nimbus, whichever comes first.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Shining Glory]</p>\n<p>Each enemy in the bright light of your nimbus attempts a @Check[will|against:class-spell] saving throw against your class DC or spell DC (whichever is higher) with the following effects. For the next minute, an enemy can't reduce its frightened condition below 1 while it remains in the bright light of your nimbus.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1}, but can immediately Step as long it moves away from you.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2} and you are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed] to that creature while it has the frightened condition.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 3} and you are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden] to that creature while it has the frightened condition.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 18
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Ascended Celestial Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
